* CLNS1 -- Client SQL lookup screen
* CLIENTID is an unprotected input field.
MAP CLNS1 SIZE 24x80
  FIELD TERMID   AT 0,70  LEN 8  PROT DIM    COLOR=BLUE
  FIELD CLIENTID AT 3,20  LEN 8  UNPROT BRIGHT COLOR=WHITE
  FIELD CLNAME   AT 5,20  LEN 35 PROT BRIGHT COLOR=GREEN
  FIELD DEPT     AT 6,20  LEN 20 PROT BRIGHT COLOR=TURQUOISE
  FIELD RANK     AT 7,20  LEN 2  PROT BRIGHT COLOR=YELLOW
  FIELD STATUS   AT 7,35  LEN 1  PROT BRIGHT COLOR=YELLOW
  FIELD SQLCD    AT 9,20  LEN 8  PROT DIM    COLOR=YELLOW
  FIELD SQLERR   AT 10,20 LEN 60 PROT DIM    COLOR=RED
  FIELD FOOTER   AT 23,2  LEN 60 PROT DIM    COLOR=BLUE
ENDMAP
